{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["And you shall command — above it says ״דבר אל בני ישראל ויקחו לי תרומה״, for the time being, for the need of the Mishkan. But here, where He commanded this for all generations, to give oil for the lamp for every single year — therefore it says ואתה תצוה: the expression changed, because every expression of צוואה is for generations and immediately. And thus it is said in Tanhuma and in the Sifre: for every expression of ציווי is nothing but immediately and for generations." "Pure — without sediment. The olives are pressed in a mortar, for those ground in a mill are not so pure."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {0 "Rashbam cites the formula 'מיד ולדורות' from rabbinic sources; I render צוואה/ציווי as 'command/commandment' to preserve his wordplay on the root."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:21.633862082Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}